  id: Urethra
  partName: Urethra
  descriptionChunks:
  - The urethra is a tube that carries urine from the bladder to the outside of the
    body. In males, it also serves as a passage for reproductive fluids. It plays
    a key role in waste elimination and maintaining fluid balance. Proper function
    is essential for urinary control and overall system efficiency.
